<title>JAPAN: Sony Music to operate 3-D movie theatre in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Sony Music to operate 3-D movie theatre in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc said on Tuesday that it would set up a firm on September 20 to operate a theatre for three-dimensional movies in Tokyo.</p>
<p>The new firm, SME Cinequest Inc, will be capitalised at 280 million yen and open a 3-D theatre on October 4 in a new department store to be launched by Takashimaya Co Ltd.</p>
<p>About 650,000 people are expected annually at the 344-seat theatre, Sony Music Entertainment said a statement.</p>
</text>
